284
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:50,000
Ancestor Du Tian's Billion-Soul Flag

285
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,280
could make even Zhuque Zi

286
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,320
think twice before acting.

287
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,890
There are no teachers in the sect,

288
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:00,730
we cultivate independently.

289
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:03,330
You've been assigned to the Soul Refining Mountain.

290
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,800
On this mountain,

291
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,760
you may choose any location

292
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,880
to establish your cultivation cave.

293
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:11,880
Inner disciple robes and token

294
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,650
are distributed in the hall.

295
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,440
Spells

296
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:16,920
are found in the scripture pavilion.

297
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:19,530
Thank you Senior Brother Wang.

298
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,450
Scripture Pavilion
Soul Refining Sect

299
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,760
Token ?

300
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,840
You can enter.

301
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,050
The third floor is off limits.

302
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,310
But you can browse freely

303
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,280
the other 2 floors.

304
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,450
Senior, I want to know

305
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:53,480
where the Soul Flag manuals are.

306
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,440
Those aren't here

307
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,890
What are you staring at ?

308
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,400
Only 10 Soul Flag jade slips exist.

309
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:03,440
If you want one

310
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,000
go steal one by force !

311
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,920
Steal it and it's yours.

312
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,930
If you have the strength to kill,

313
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,930
then kill.

314
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,250
See something you like ?

315
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,040
Steal it.

316
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,290
Fancy a female cultivator ?

317
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,200
Just take her.

318
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:17,720
Take what you want by strength,

319
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,320
that's the law of the Soul Refining Sect !

320
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,600
No rules ?

321
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,240
Complete freedom ?

322
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,720
That's quite an unusual sect...

323
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:27,880
Brat

324
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,560
You're the fifth in 100 years

325
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:31,200
that has tried to attack me.

326
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,490
Okay, this old man will play with you !

327
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:39,480
Grandfather, please stop !

328
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,480
Our Inner sect has another rule.

329
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,360
A rule ?

330
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,250
You can steal,

331
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:47,330
but if someone surrenders, don't kill them.

332
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:53,960
Junior Brother,

333
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,680
there's a jade slip right there.

334
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,960
The Soul Refining Sect

335
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:02,920
has gained another person not to be messed with.

336
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:15,080
You destroyed my cave,

337
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,850
are you looking for death ?!

338
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:21,440
Each soul is strong,

339
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,840
some even rival the pressure of Core Formation cultivators.

340
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,600
This Soul Flag is good,

341
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,490
Hundred-Soul Flag

342
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,320
I'll take it.

343
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,770
I surrender !

344
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,440
I surrender...

345
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,650
Jade slip, Soul Flag,

346
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,480
they're yours.

347
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,530
Soul Refining jade slip

348
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,120
I have two concubines too,

349
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,760
take them !

350
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:50,600
By the rules,

351
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,560
you can't kill me !

352
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:00,850
While it does contain Soul Flag refining methods,

353
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,560
it seems

354
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,720
this jade is still incomplete.

355
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:07,690
Xu Jun
Soul Refining Sect Inner Disciple
Middle stage Core Formation

356
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,440
Senior Brother,

357
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,880
did you notice that this Soul Flag method

358
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,040
is flawed ?

359
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,920
You must be Qian Mu,

360
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,640
this year's outer disciple competition winner.

361
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,450
Junior Sister Xu Yun

362
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,280
greets Senior Brother.

363
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:20,450
The Soul Flag refining method

364
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,800
is flawed because it's split into 3 parts.

365
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,880
They're named after the 3 mountains.

366
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,160
They're called

367
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,330
Soul Refining,

368
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,690
Soul Extracting,

369
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:30,050
and Soul Sealing.

370
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,440
If you combine all 3

371
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:34,410
you will get the true Soul Flag refining method.

372
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,600
Don't follow me !

373
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:46,330
Main Spirit Vein mine
Soul Refining Sect

374
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:07,890
The main Spirit Vein's spiritual energy is so dense

375
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,840
that taking a little shouldn't matter.

376
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,150
Could this be...

377
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,410
an ancient soul restriction ?

378
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,770
It uses souls to create restrictions.

379
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:25,330
Not only is it unpredictable,

380
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:27,810
but it's even more powerful than ordinary restrictions.

381
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,130
This kind of restriction

382
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:32,010
must hide a treasure.

383
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:37,410
There is soul energy inside it

384
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:40,370
but I don't know if it's a treasure or a curse.

385
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,170
Since I'm in this situation,

386
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,250
I will take the risk.

387
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:47,890
Break !

388
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,330
Is this...

389
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:31,860
To let go of the consequences of my actions

390
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:33,580
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

391
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:35,520
like scattered ink.

392
00:20:36,150 --> 00:20:43,000
As destiny falls

393
00:20:38,990 --> 00:20:43,000
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

394
00:20:42,750 --> 00:20:50,600
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

395
00:20:45,990 --> 00:20:50,600
wither and melt into rivers.

396
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:58,160
Who can deceive

397
00:20:53,550 --> 00:20:58,160
the law of the heavens ?

398
00:20:58,230 --> 00:21:01,480
Countless generations

399
00:20:59,510 --> 00:21:01,480
have tried before me.

400
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:05,200
But how could I not catch my dreams

401
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:05,200
within my warm fingers ?

402
00:21:05,510 --> 00:21:09,280
You're at my side when I'm alone

403
00:21:09,030 --> 00:21:12,600
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

404
00:21:13,110 --> 00:21:16,560
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

405
00:21:16,670 --> 00:21:20,760
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

406
00:21:18,510 --> 00:21:20,760
in the streets.

407
00:21:20,670 --> 00:21:25,720
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

408
00:21:22,230 --> 00:21:25,720
Can I break the rules ?

409
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:28,440
To run towards you !

410
00:21:28,230 --> 00:21:31,760
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

411
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:36,400
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

412
00:21:36,150 --> 00:21:39,800
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

413
00:21:39,590 --> 00:21:44,480
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

414
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:50,160
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

415
00:21:50,030 --> 00:21:54,080
If your soul is willing to wander,

416
00:21:53,830 --> 00:21:58,720
can I still take your hands

417
00:21:55,510 --> 00:21:58,720
and hold them tight ?

418
00:21:58,630 --> 00:22:01,800
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

419
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:06,680
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

420
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:09,960
I dream of destroying

421
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:14,680
the shackles of our fate.

422
00:22:14,430 --> 00:22:18,640
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

423
00:22:18,390 --> 00:22:21,440
You're the hardest to let go of.

424
00:22:21,270 --> 00:22:25,320
I want to be with you again

425
00:22:25,150 --> 00:22:28,680
so I can look in your eyes.

426
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:33,920
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
